  VALUES ('Foundation year one doctor Remi is on the ward when the on-call registrar, who is leaving urgently for a trauma call, asks him to perform a pleural aspiration on a patient with a new significant pleural effusion. Remi has observed the procedure twice during medical school but has never performed one under supervision and has not been signed off as competent to do so.

How appropriate are each of the following responses by Remi?')
  RETURNING id INTO v_s10;

